    {
      "type": "coach",
      "note": "The official NXL World Cup 2026 maps (labeled 2D, clean 2D and two 3D renders) as published by NXL, sent by the coach on 4 Nov 2026. The maps print 'Nov 11-15, 2026 \u00b7 Kissimmee, FL'."
    }
